flowchart TD
    A[SKSE plugin load] --> B[Settings/defaults/overrides]
    B --> C[Module registry and Module.ini validation]
    C --> D[PostPostLoad/DataLoaded hooks]
    D --> E[D3D11 device and swap-chain creation]
    E --> F[Resource setup and shader-cache validation]

    F --> G[Present hook: State.Reset]
    G --> H[Frame snapshot: SharedData b5 / FeatureData b6 / FrameBuffer b12]
    H --> I[Main_RenderShadowMaps]
    I --> J[EarlyPrepass scheduler]
    J --> K[Main_RenderWorld_Start]
    K --> L[Deferred target remap and Prepass scheduler]
    L --> M[Skyrim geometry through shader hooks]
    M --> N[Albedo/specular/reflectance/normal/masks/motion/depth]
    N --> O[Blended decals and Terrain Seam boundary]
    O --> P[EndDeferred: restore forward targets]

    P --> Q[Material Layers effects depth]
    Q --> R[Hybrid GI / probes / SSS / indirect lighting]
    R --> S[DeferredCompositeCS]
    S --> T[Main color + final normals/TAA mask + motion]
    T --> U[Distant Life]
    U --> V[Reactive FX]
    V --> W[Rain runoff / late world-probe work]
    W --> X[Contained Liquids replay]

    X --> PW[Pre-water depth copy after EndDeferred]
    PW --> FW[Skyrim forward water/transparency/effects]
    FW --> AC{Runtime reconstruction method}
    AC -->|FSR/DLSS| Z[PixelAnnotations base]
    Z --> Y[Image Reconstruction encode: explicit CS b5]
    Y --> AA[Reactive contributors]
    AA --> AB[Depth/motion/reactive/transparency publication]
    AB --> BC{Backend dispatch succeeds}
    AC -->|NONE| AD[Native image-space path]
    AC -->|TAA| AE[TAA path]
    BC -->|FSR success| AF[FSR path: upscale depth]
    BC -->|DLSS success| AG[DLSS path: upscale depth/sharpen]
    BC -->|failure| AD
    AG --> AH{Optional neural/frame generation}
    AH --> AI[Capability-gated side path]

    AD --> AJ[Skyrim ISHDR]
    AE --> AJ
    AF --> AJ
    AI --> AJ
    AJ --> AK[CameraSuite HDR/camera finishing]
    AK --> AL[Output compute or safe framebuffer copy]
    AL --> AM[Swap-chain back buffer]
    AM --> AN[IDXGISwapChain::Present]

    subgraph Temporal[Temporal and annotation services]
        T1[TemporalContext]
        T2[RenderOrigin epoch]
        T3[PixelAnnotations]
        T4[ReconstructionContext]
    end
    H -. current/previous matrices .-> T1
    H -. discontinuity .-> T2
    T1 -. history validity .-> Y
    S -. base masks .-> T3
    Y -. publish base .-> T3
    T4 -. reactive contributors .-> AA

    subgraph Depth[Depth and collision resources]
        D1[Main depth]
        D2[POST_ZPREPASS_COPY]
        D3[Effects depth]
        D4[Terrain Seam depth]
        D5[Normal/roughness]
        D6[Refraction normals]
    end
    N --> D1
    PW --> D2
    Q --> D3
    O --> D4
    N --> D5
    E --> D6
    D1 --> R
    D2 -. earlier prepass copy or Terrain Seam .-> V
    D5 --> V
    D1 --> Y
